{"type":"log","callId":"ziqi@254","time":28063.53,"message":"  unexpected value \"FACILITY CODE: ROOM-08 // SYSTEM OPERATIONSMission ControlOpen Command Palette⌘K / Ctrl+KCentral operational console for KAI Headquarters. Execute universal knowledge base searches, inspect facility telemetry, monitor application subsystems, and access rapid command routing across the portfolio.Search KAI HQ Knowledge BaseUniversal deterministic search indexing all engineering projects, competencies, career milestones, certifications, and documents.Command Palette⌘K / Ctrl+KESC to clearBegin typing in the search console above or press ⌘K / Ctrl+K to launch the command palette.Projects4Skills20Timeline Records5Achievements5Resume Variants4Facility Rooms8Facility Subsystem Operational States// APPLICATION-LOCAL OPERATIONAL STATESExperience EngineClient-side room state, visitor mode & assistive router● ONLINEKnowledge EngineDeterministic in-memory portfolio index & search engine● ONLINEPortfolio TelemetryStructured Knowledge Base (1.0.0)● READYNavigation SubsystemHistory API router & 8 facility routes● ONLINEDocument Vault4 role-tailored resume specifications indexed● READYCommunication CenterVerified email, GitHub & LinkedIn direct channels● ACTIVEData Integrity & Knowledge Repository TelemetryDETERMINISTIC IN-MEMORY REPOSITORYRepository OwnerKamalesh Suresh KumarSchema Version1.0.0System AvailabilityONLINE (v1.0.0)Search Index IntegrityDETERMINISTIC (0 ms latency)KAI HQ Facility DirectoryUnified directory of the 8 specialized rooms and operational consoles in the headquarters.8 TOTAL FACILITIESROOM-01● ONLINELobbyWelcome hub, identity summary, AI core visualization, and primary entry point to KAI HQ.// Orientation & Core SystemsNavigateROOM-02● ONLINEEngineering LaboratoryFilterable collection of engineering specimens, deep-dive architectural notes, and project repositories.// Software Projects & ArchitecturesNavigateROOM-03● ONLINEMemory ArchiveChronological timeline of education, software engineering internships, naval cadetship, and technical society roles.// Career & Academic HistoryNavigateROOM-04● ONLINEAchievement HallEvidentiary gallery showcasing law enforcement demonstrations, verified enterprise certifications, and leadership honors.// Credentials & VerificationsNavigateROOM-05● ONLINEDocument VaultRole-tailored resume variants (Full-Stack, Backend, Cybersecurity, AI/Systems) with direct download capabilities.// Deliverable DocumentsNavigateROOM-06● ONLINECommunication CenterDirect communication channels, GitHub repository coordinates, email links, and network presence.// Communication & OutletsNavigateROOM-07● ONLINESkill ProcessorStructured matrix of programming languages, frameworks, security toolchains, and architectural domains with project linkages.// Skills & ProficienciesNavigateROOM-08● CURRENT FACILITYMission ControlCentral command surface offering full-text knowledge search, system telemetry, and visitor mode configuration.// Command & Search OperationsViewing\""}
